This version of Terminaux is a monthly release intended to make your console applications more powerful while introducing new features.

### Changes

This release contains a variety of changes, including, but not limited to:

- `[+]` Added new search mode for selection infoboxes
- `[+]` Added a way for apps to determine whether a reader input was cancelled
- `[+]` Added a horizontal value showcase renderer
- `[+]` Added a way for custom keybindings to exit interactive TUIs
- `[+]` Added back table choice style removed from v5.0
- `[*]` Improved keybinding handling for the keybindings list
- `[*]` Fixed search pointing to a wrong item
- `[*]` Fixed some charts rendering out of bounds
- `[*]` General improvements and bug fixes

Review the commit history if you want to get a deep insight about the changes.

### Feedback?

If you have issues with this version, report to us by [making a new issue ticket](https://github.com/Aptivi/Terminaux/issues/new).

